  "title": "Privia Health to Report Third Quarter 2025 Results on Thursday, November 6",
  "summary": "ARLINGTON, Va., Oct. 07, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Privia Health Group, Inc. (Nasdaq: PRVA) today announced that it expects to release financial results for its third-quarter and nine-month periods ended September 30, 2025 before market open on Thursday, November 6, 2025.",
